[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3302464103","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110587#issuecomment-3302464103","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110587","id":3302464103,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E15pn","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T11:02:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T11:02:22Z","body":"Does it work if adding a delay before checking the value, like so:\n```gdscript\nvar music_bus_idx = AudioServer.get_bus_index(\"Music\")\nif music_bus_idx != -1:\n    print(\"Before:\", AudioServer.get_bus_volume_db(music_bus_idx))\n    AudioServer.set_bus_volume_db(music_bus_idx, linear_to_db(0.5))  # Set to 50% volume\n    await get_tree().process_frame\n    print(\"After:\", AudioServer.get_bus_volume_db(music_bus_idx))\n    # Both print statements show the same value\n```\n\nThere might be a delay where the update is processed by the OS","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3302464103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303022868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110587#issuecomment-3303022868","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110587","id":3303022868,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E4CEU","user":{"login":"KacperPiotrowski","id":122211801,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0jN2Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122211801?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski","html_url":"https://github.com/KacperPiotrowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T13:29:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T13:39:45Z","body":"After further testing, I discovered that AudioServer.set_bus_volume_db() actually does work and correctly changes the audio volume (setting volume to 0.1 made audio noticeably quieter). However, AudioServer.get_bus_volume_db() continues to return the previous value instead of reflecting the update.\n\nThis means the actual problem is with:\n\nReading current values - AudioServer.get_bus_volume_db() doesn't return updated values\nInternal state update delay - There might be a synchronization issue\nGetter function bug - The function itself might have a bug in returning proper values\nTest results with volume 0.1:\n\nAudio actually becomes quieter (setter works)\nBut get_bus_volume_db() still returns the old value (-1.938...)\nThe issue is specifically with the getter function not updating its return value\nCode that demonstrates this behavior:\n\n```gdscript\nvar music_bus_idx = AudioServer.get_bus_index(\"Music\")\nif music_bus_idx != -1:\n    print(\"Before:\", AudioServer.get_bus_volume_db(music_bus_idx))\n    AudioServer.set_bus_volume_db(music_bus_idx, linear_to_db(0.1))\n    await get_tree().process_frame\n    print(\"After set to 0.1:\", AudioServer.get_bus_volume_db(music_bus_idx))\n    # Audio is quieter, but getter returns old value\n```\nThe volume change is audible, but the getter function doesn't report the correct value. This creates the false impression that the setter isn't working.\n\nLet me know if you need me to run any additional tests to help identify the root cause of this getter/setter synchronization issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303022868/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303084783","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110587#issuecomment-3303084783","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110587","id":3303084783,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E4RLv","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T13:45:04Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T13:45:04Z","body":"This is necessarily macOS specific as it works fine on Windows","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303084783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303307295","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110587#issuecomment-3303307295","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110587","id":3303307295,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E5Hgf","user":{"login":"KacperPiotrowski","id":122211801,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0jN2Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122211801?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski","html_url":"https://github.com/KacperPiotrowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/gists{/gist_id}",