"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T14:36:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T14:36:22Z","body":"Did you solve it? There was no reason to close this I just confirmed that it at least doesn't happen on Windows","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303315090/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303356643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110587#issuecomment-3303356643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110587","id":3303356643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E5Tjj","user":{"login":"KacperPiotrowski","id":122211801,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0jN2Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122211801?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski","html_url":"https://github.com/KacperPiotrowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KacperPiotrowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T14:44:59Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T14:44:59Z","body":"Sorry, I closed this too early. After thinking about it - this is a real bug that should be fixed.\nUpdated problem description:\n\nAudioServer.set_bus_volume_db() works correctly (audio actually changes)\nAudioServer.get_bus_volume_db() returns stale values on macOS\nIssue only occurs on macOS, works fine on Windows\n\nWhy this needs to be fixed:\n\nGetter/setter desync makes UI creation difficult (volume sliders)\nProblematic for audio debugging\nInconsistent behavior between platforms\nOther macOS developers likely have the same issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303356643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303364459","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110587#issuecomment-3303364459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110587","id":3303364459,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E5Vdr","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/